    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, i know you're trying to help but it feels like you're just saying stuff that doesn't apply here. like what's the point of \"anchoring\" something that's already broken/gone? it feels more logical than anything to just admit that the person i used to be is just... done. it's exhausting pretending there's still a \"me\" to save.",
